        {
          "commit": "1ae1c85dae55e7b1215a6dc233796d36ec7d7c25",
          "git_sha": "e2c8ced6b29e09de8f4d72d115ffdfaf6d86cb48",
          "line_end": 74,
          "line_start": 67,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "withastro/flue",
          "url": "https://github.com/withastro/flue/blob/1ae1c85dae55e7b1215a6dc233796d36ec7d7c25/README.md#L67-L74"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5db1d58633ca37c237d73fc95a247d70e9c4b4d1e97dd22a894d10b0301d1ba8"
      ],
      "text": "The repository ships @flue/runtime (harness, sessions, tools, sandbox), @flue/vite (build plugin), @flue/cli (flue binary), @flue/sdk (client for deployed agent conversations), @flue/opentelemetry, and @flue/postgres."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_cb4ba6a79e752df37187c870718302fc4d1e612ded6898a23aae7c647ca70db2",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "1ae1c85dae55e7b1215a6dc233796d36ec7d7c25",
          "git_sha": "e2c8ced6b29e09de8f4d72d115ffdfaf6d86cb48",
          "line_end": 40,
          "line_start": 40,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "withastro/flue",
          "url": "https://github.com/withastro/flue/blob/1ae1c85dae55e7b1215a6dc233796d36ec7d7c25/README.md#L40-L40"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_295f722ed81a423e6f6e724d0d9f9a8d37e7b1a8a2591a1fc7064bdd2ddebdeb"
      ],
      "text": "The built-in TypeScript harness gives models sessions, tools, skills, instructions, filesystem access, and a secure sandbox; agents run locally via CLI or deploy to a hosted runtime."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0d85643aa9a1e57c9eacfcdf428c0105778f73da45c25a8f5884689154bca12d",
