          "git_sha": "e2c8ced6b29e09de8f4d72d115ffdfaf6d86cb48",
          "line_end": 74,
          "line_start": 67,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "withastro/flue",
          "url": "https://github.com/withastro/flue/blob/1ae1c85dae55e7b1215a6dc233796d36ec7d7c25/README.md#L67-L74"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5db1d58633ca37c237d73fc95a247d70e9c4b4d1e97dd22a894d10b0301d1ba8"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI exposes a `flue` binary for local runs, blueprints, and offline docs; @flue/sdk is a client SDK for consuming deployed agent conversations."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_22ba5b0dab1a2e4cfe42b86a03446c8b1391c2b0866153642af31951c89754b6",
