        "slc_fd401e4b77a22267fa6e87f029243943eac62b98a0d716364a4bf4349f7472ab"
      ],
      "text": "Agents can connect to authenticated tools and services through MCP servers, and telemetry can be exported via OpenTelemetry and Braintrust."
    },
